<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Thursday it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues slated for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Hillsborough Board Education, N.J., $39 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Midwest City Independent School District No 52, Okla., $8.69 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--St George, Utah, $12 million GOs, by direct purchase.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
